    "caption": "🔥Astana Hub participated in the Central Asia Regional Economic Cooperation Innovation Week & Digital Economy Tour in Hangzhou, People’s Republic of China 🇨🇳\n\n🌐 CAREC Innovation Week and Digital Economy Tour held on 22–24 November provides a platform for sharing knowledge and experience, creating networks, and exploring mechanisms to undertake innovative solutions and promote a digital economy.\n\n☄️ Astana Hub shared experiences, interacted with both the public and private stakeholders within the CAREC region and beyond and delivered a presentation on “Astana Hub’s Role in Empowering the Region’s Cross Boarder Collaboration”.",
